        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Cream felted wool cardinal's hat, the top covered with faded red, cotton/silk. Wide brim, shallow crown. The underside of the brim has been dyed to match the top. Narrow cotton cord attached on either side of the crown, falling behind the head to end in bunches of tassels."@en ;
